  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Honey hot chicken delivers bold comfort with crispy, spice-kissed chicken coated in a glossy swirl of golden honey and warming heat. Juicy strips are marinated with chili flakes, smoked paprika, and a hint of citrus, then seared until perfectly crunchy. A smooth honey and mustard glaze brings sweet balance to the fiery notes, clinging to every bite. Served over fluffy jasmine rice or tucked into soft flatbreads, this playful favorite is perfect for weeknight cravings or relaxed gatherings, offering big flavor and pure satisfaction.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-honey-hot-chicken\">Why You’ll Love This honey hot chicken</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-honey-hot-chicken\">How to Make Honey Hot Chicken</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-honey-hot-chicken\">Pro Tips for Making Honey Hot Chicken</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-honey-hot-chicken\">How to Serve this honey hot chicken</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-honey-hot-chicken\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This honey hot chicken</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It’s a perfect blend of sweet and spicy that dances on your taste buds.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make, so you can whip it up for any occasion.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for meal prep, keeping your weeknight dinners exciting.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Family-friendly and sure to please even the pickiest eaters.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile enough to pair with your favorite sides or enjoy on its own.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-10400\" cl